# `packages/office/univer` pins Univer insider builds (`1.0.0-insiders.*`) that
# only the Univer insider registry serves; npmjs carries the same scopes at
# older public tags, so without this scoping `pnpm install` reports the pinned
# version as nonexistent. Anonymous read; no token.
@univer-cli:registry=https://insider-npm-registry.univer.work/
@univerjs:registry=https://insider-npm-registry.univer.work/
@univerjs-pro:registry=https://insider-npm-registry.univer.work/
